    <div class="zrm-section-title"><strong>Recent productions</strong><button>View all</button></div><div class="zrm-grid-12"><article class="zrm-card zrm-production-card span-4" style="--accent:#d84275"><div class="zrm-production-cover"></div><h3>Japan Hidden Spring</h3><p>Article · YouTube · Reel · 5 outputs</p></article><article class="zrm-card zrm-production-card span-4" style="--accent:#477df2"><div class="zrm-production-cover"></div><h3>Procedural City Tool</h3><p>Case study · Trailer · LinkedIn</p></article><article class="zrm-card zrm-production-card span-4" style="--accent:#ff793d"><div class="zrm-production-cover"></div><h3>ZenRayMedia Product Thesis</h3><p>Article · Deck · Product film</p></article></div>
